# Allowlist: ignore every top-level path, then un-ignore what belongs in this repo.
# New folders at the Klei mods root (Steam, local, config, …) stay out until listed here.

/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md

!.cursor/
!.cursor/**

!src/
!src/**

!ref/
!ref/oni-api/
!ref/oni-api/**

# Build / IDE inside allowed trees
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# API scan scratch
ref/oni-api/_scans/
